config AIC8800D80_USB
	tristate "AICSemi AIC8800D80 USB support"
	depends on WLAN && USB && CFG80211
	select FW_LOADER
	help
	  This staging driver supports the AICSemi AIC8800D80 USB Wi-Fi
	  device used on the Radxa ROCK 4D. The device initially enumerates
	  as USB ID a69c:8d80. The aic_load_fw module loads its firmware,
	  after which it re-enumerates as a69c:8d81. The aic8800_fdrv
	  module then provides the cfg80211 network interface.
	  To compile this driver as modules, choose M here. The modules will
	  be called aic_load_fw and aic8800_fdrv.
